{"id":"msg_m_ex_onemoretime_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_onemoretime","label":"For the 1st Place · Group"},"label":"2. Great job at practice today, everyone.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_onemoretime_01","next":"msg_m_ex_onemoretime_03","speakers":{"bay":"Bay","clay":"Clay","poli_c":"Poli"},"icons":{"bay":"si_c550_00_s","clay":"si_c551_00_s","poli_c":"si_c030_02_s"},"lines":[{"id":"msg_m_ex_onemoretime_02_unlock","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"text":"Unlocks: Clear event stage 104410105 · After For the 1st Place chat 1. Bay has invited {AccountData.NickName} to join…","key":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_1","text":"Great job at practice today, everyone.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_2","text":"We're off to a great start.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_3","text":"You all kicked butt out there!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_4","text":"By the way, sorry that I was late T_T","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_5","text":"It's okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_6","text":"It happens.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli_c","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_7","text":"Yeah, it's all good.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_8","text":"How are you holding up, Poli?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_9","text":"Was everything today okay?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli_c","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_10","text":"Ah.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli_c","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_11","text":"I was a little worried since it was my first time cheerleading,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli_c","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_12","text":"but it was a ton of fun!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli_c","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_13","text":"Plus, it's a great workout.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_14","text":"I had a good time too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli_c","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_15","text":"I saw you out there breaking a sweat with the rest of us, Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_16","text":"Yeah.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_17","text":"I must admit that I was surprised, Coach. You did better than I thought you would.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_18","text":"Have you been getting private lessons, by any chance?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_19","text":"My original dream was actually to become a cheerleader.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_20","text":"Is that so?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_21","text":"How interesting.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_22","text":"Aw, c'mon, Bay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_23","text":"Put a little more life into your responses!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_24","text":"T_T","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli_c","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_25","text":"Anyway,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli_c","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_26","text":"I totally think being a cheerleader is like the coolest job ever!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli_c","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_27","text":"Motivating other people","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli_c","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_28","text":"and giving them strength","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli_c","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_29","text":"is super commendable!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli_c","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_30","text":"Not only that, but when I'm out there,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli_c","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_31","text":"I feel like I'm cheering myself on as well, which gives me a real boost.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_32","text":"Thank you for saying that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_33","text":"Yeah, super motivating, Poli! I'm gonna cheer even harder next time 'cause of you, hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_34","text":"Once again, good job today, everyone.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_35","text":"Get some rest,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_36","text":"and I'll see you tomorrow.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli_c","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_37","text":"Will do!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli_c","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_38","text":"Be sure to get some rest yourself, Bay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_39","text":"See you all tomorrow!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_onemoretime_02_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_onemoretime_02_40","text":"Later, guys.","jump":null}],"chat":true}